 about breaking it.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah,it is also a first class ticket for a top spot on the Red List.<br /> Or for an assassination directive from the NWO.<br /> <br /> <br /> It would quite the scene: a man in black and a archon ringing at the mage bell to ask him if he knows the word of our lord jesus christ.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T15:19:10-07:00","id":958912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead rabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/865973-mages-breaking-the-masquerade?p=958875#post958875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah,it is also a first class ticket for a top spot on the Red List.<br /> Or for an assassination directive from the NWO.<br /> <br /> <br /> It would quite the scene: a man in black and a archon ringing at the mage bell to ask him if he knows the word of our lord jesus christ.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, which is the point.<br /> <br /> You break the Masquerade and the Camarilla will burn. The Technocracy will fall.<br /> <br /> It's a WAR.<br /> <br /> The vampires and Technocracy are nothing before humans simply realizing their slave masters are weak frightened old man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"ht